{"title":"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An urn is filled with coins and beads, all of which are either silver or gold. Twenty percent of the objects in the urn are beads. Forty percent of the coins in the urn are silver. What percent of objects in the urn are gold coins?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a9388faa1b880868de6d5aa0712492aba36ce2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 40\\%\\quad \\text{(B) } 48\\%\\quad \\text{(C) } 52\\%\\quad \\text{(D) } 60\\%\\quad \\text{(E) } 80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"384\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If twenty percent of the objects in the urn are beads, then the other <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% of the objects must be coins. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% of the coins are silver, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% of the coins must be gold. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% of the objects in the urn are gold coins. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/0/560bbe98575be14edb662af40d461d72b73b26f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.6\\times.8=.48$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"13\" />, 48 percent of the objects in the urn must be gold coins. Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME\" title=\"1992 AHSME\">1992 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\